{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_16201230","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1620122001:":{"text":"……ぺブルちゃん？","source_cn":"……小石头？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8775C561EE53E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620123001:1":{"text":"本当に……ぺブルちゃんなの。でも……どうしてここに？","source_cn":"小石头……真的是它。可……它怎么会来这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2D285FBD92139E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620123002:1":{"text":"アルチカさん、あのネコを知ってるんですか？","source_cn":"教授，你认识那只小猫灵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DAFC3D557D7AF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620123003:1":{"text":"ええ。一瞬しか見えなかったけど間違いない。あれは私が生前に飼っていたペットよ。名前を<style=\"highlight\">ぺブル</style>というの。","source_cn":"嗯。虽然只有一瞬间，但我很确定，那就是我生前养的魔宠。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49F27D12BDC61D66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620123004:1":{"text":"まさか、アルチカさんがずっと探していた墓荒らしが、かつて飼っていたペットだなんて……","source_cn":"没想到教授一直在找的墓地作乱的犯人，竟然是她以前的魔宠……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F275F193496ACD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620123005:1":{"text":"ゴホンッ！言葉遣いに気を付けなさい！むやみに「墓荒らし」なんて言うものじゃない！","source_cn":"咳咳！请注意描述的准确性，不要随便乱用“作乱”这种词语。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE145F0C9556DCC67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620123006:1":{"text":"夜中に走り回るのは猫の本能。それをよく墓荒らしだなんて言えたわね？","source_cn":"夜晚喜欢奔跑、蹦跳，这是猫的天性，怎么能叫作乱呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DEE6813EC276368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620123007:1":{"text":"アルチカさん、僕を見つけた時とぜんぜん違うじゃないですか！","source_cn":"教授，您之前对我可不是这个态度啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18084F37D540B834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1620123007":{"text":"アルチカさん、僕を見つけた時とぜんぜん違うじゃないですか！","source_cn":"教授，您之前对我可不是这个态度啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18084F37D540B834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620123008:1":{"text":"何を言ってるの？ネコが本能を抑えられないのは仕方ないけど、あなたは人間でしょ？","source_cn":"在夜里跑跳是猫的天性，它控制不住自己。你是人，难道也控...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19BBA0CC0DE12C6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620123009:1":{"text":"それに狩猟本能が満たされているというのは、体が健康で、活力に溢れている証拠よ。","source_cn":"再说了，晚上不睡觉模仿捕猎，说明猫的身体健康，很有活力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41AA70C4C643BA17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620123010:0":{"text":"人間のあなたに狩猟本能があるの？あるならそれこそ、魔法薬で抑えないと。","source_cn":"你们年轻人晚上不睡觉来墓园里捣乱，那说明该用魔药治一治了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98CBAEE6767FAB6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620123011:0":{"text":"ぼ、僕は……ああ、どう反論すればいいんだ……","source_cn":"我、我……竟然想不出该怎么反驳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB10FD15FD94C195","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620123016:0":{"text":"でも不思議なのは……私は生前、ぺブルちゃんをある生徒に託したの。彼女は卒業後、ぺブルちゃんを連れて<style=\"highlight\">ユグドラシル</style>の実家へ帰ったはずなのに……","source_cn":"说起来有些奇怪……我生前把小石头送给了学生，她毕业后就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D61CCF485F663F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620123017:1":{"text":"アルチカさん、その墓を荒ら……いや、「本能を発揮」しているぺブルちゃんを、どうするつもりですか？","source_cn":"教授，那小石头作乱……呃，我是说，小石头“展现天性”打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3B2141207572BF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1620123018:1":{"text":"我慢する。","source_cn":"忍着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF129647843FBC728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1620123019:0":{"text":"が、我慢するだけですか？","source_cn":"就、就只是忍着吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F288C1D83607A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1620123020:1":{"text":"他にどうしろというの？この子は生前から騒がしく、毎日私を眠らせてくれなかった。夜になると部屋中を駆け回って、私の体もお構いなしに踏みつける。","source_cn":"还能怎么办？这个小家伙生前就天天吵得我睡不着觉，我活了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0816318577E901B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1620123021:1":{"text":"長い年月を共に過ごして解決策が見つからなかったんだから、どうしようもないじゃない。","source_cn":"它从小就精力充沛，一到晚上就在房间里到处蹦蹦跳跳，还喜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54D42E3211C7A97B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1620123022:0":{"text":"うーん……魔法薬も効かないのでしょうか？","source_cn":"唔……连魔法药剂也没有用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7A207D6D08E5D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1620123023:1":{"text":"効かない。あなたたちが思いつきそうなことは全部試したわ。